This data is downloaded from the following link:
Multi-omic profiling of the developing human cerebral cortex at the single cell level
https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/collections/ceb895f4-ff9f-403a-b7c3-187a9657ac2c

The data is generated by 10x multiomics platform.
Both scRNA-seq and scATAC-seq data are available, in h5ad or Seurat object format.
I downloaded scRNA-seq data in Seurat format here.

File list in the current folder:

developing_brain.rds -- Seurat object of scRNA-seq data
human_developing_brain_scPred_model.rds -- pre-trained scPred model of developing brain
scPred_default_model_performance_HumanDevBrain.pdf -- the plot showing performance evaluation of the model above
README -- This description file

